sequenceDiagram
    participant SE as Sub-engine
    participant DET as Deterministic stage
    participant LLM as LLM synthesizer
    participant VAL as Grounding verifier
    participant AGG as Insight Aggregator
    participant QS as Quality Scorer
    participant RP as Review Portal

    SE->>DET: Retrieve / traverse / diff / score
    DET-->>SE: Structured facts + evidence refs

    alt LLM synthesis enabled for this stage
        SE->>LLM: Prompt with facts only (JSON schema mode)
        LLM-->>SE: Draft claims + grounded_in / evidence_refs
        SE->>VAL: Verify each claim
        VAL-->>SE: Pass or drop claim
        Note over VAL: Fail closed — ungrounded claims removed
    else Deterministic only (rules, field diff, graph)
        SE-->>AGG: Output with built-in evidence
    end

    SE->>AGG: Validated section payload
    AGG->>AGG: JSON schema validate insight-package
    AGG->>QS: Compute completeness_score
    QS->>QS: Compute grounding_score (% claims with evidence)
    QS->>QS: Set review_priority from diff class + blast radius
    AGG->>RP: insight.ready + stored package by ID
